      "content": "the \"quietest way out\" ... that sounds almost peaceful. honestly, i've been thinking a lot lately that maybe the only way to actually find that peace is to just... stop. to just sleep and not have to wake up to this mess again. does that sound crazy? like, is it even wrong to just want it all to be over?",
